{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/3e2a31d029937da707557bf439a1c8f9.poster.avif?t=1759179387\" aria-label=\"A worn leather boot, floating at the bottom of a well\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/3e2a31d029937da707557bf439a1c8f9.webm?t=1759179387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/3e2a31d029937da707557bf439a1c8f9.mp4?t=1759179387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a lightning-charged mouse defending your home \u2014 a worn leather shoe at the bottom of a well. Face waves of insectoid invaders and strike them down with automatically fired bolts of lightning.\u00a0<strong>This demo has a time limitation of 20 minutes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/f5e8fb16bab8f2308a253601d358a48f.avif?t=1759179387\" alt=\"Intense bullet hell\" data-has-big width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight increasingly difficult enemy waves, each unique and with a different attack. You\u2019ll be on the edge of your seat through 30 distinct waves across three levels. Every encounter is tense, unpredictable, and packed with action. <strong>This demo is limited to the first level.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/c058073838f9a3e39f81243405121b7d.avif?t=1759179387\" alt=\"A variety of upgrades\" data-has-big width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins from defeated enemies to upgrade 24 different properties and unique abilities called \u201cWishes.\u201d These include powerful new weapons, economic effects, weapon modifiers, stat boosts, and more, fueling a strong progression curve.<strong> This demo is limited to eight Wishes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/71eff91d9c60ce7f999ec07edb4031f3.avif?t=1759179387\" alt=\"Distinctive flap-style movement\" data-has-big width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master movement in this unique twist on the genre. Flap left or right to move horizontally, and adjust your flapping speed to control altitude. You can also dash sideways to dodge tricky projectiles. This elegant control scheme is easy to learn, yet offers expressive, skillful movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/191561bf189c03e5aec91b34fde47d73.avif?t=1759179387\" alt=\"Epic boss battles\" data-has-big width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer huge bosses at the end of each level. With layered attack patterns and multiple phases, these extended battles deliver a distinct challenge beyond regular enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/10336a65d4d2331334b165b96d0c15ba.avif?t=1759179387\" alt=\"Immense power trip\" data-has-big width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When defeated, you lose your coins and restart from the beginning of the level, but keep your acquired Wishes. This makes you more powerful each time you begin a new run, creating a thrilling sense of exponential domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994590?t=1759179387","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/3ab2b30947450096bf57b1e18845fd76835bf26b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759179387","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/5d68bb00158119c1cacb126452810440b6d1ba4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759179387","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/5d68bb00158119c1cacb126452810440b6d1ba4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759179387","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/3e2a31d029937da707557bf439a1c8f9.poster.avif?t=1759179387\" aria-label=\"A worn leather boot, floating at the bottom of a well\" width=1170 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/3e2a31d029937da707557bf439a1c8f9.webm?t=1759179387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/3e2a31d029937da707557bf439a1c8f9.mp4?t=1759179387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a lightning-charged mouse defending your home \u2014 a worn leather shoe at the bottom of a well. Face waves of insectoid invaders and strike them down with automatically fired bolts of lightning.\u00a0<strong>This demo has a time limitation of 20 minutes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/f5e8fb16bab8f2308a253601d358a48f.avif?t=1759179387\" alt=\"Intense bullet hell\" data-has-big width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight increasingly difficult enemy waves, each unique and with a different attack. You\u2019ll be on the edge of your seat through 30 distinct waves across three levels. Every encounter is tense, unpredictable, and packed with action. <strong>This demo is limited to the first level.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/c058073838f9a3e39f81243405121b7d.avif?t=1759179387\" alt=\"A variety of upgrades\" data-has-big width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins from defeated enemies to upgrade 24 different properties and unique abilities called \u201cWishes.\u201d These include powerful new weapons, economic effects, weapon modifiers, stat boosts, and more, fueling a strong progression curve.<strong> This demo is limited to eight Wishes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/71eff91d9c60ce7f999ec07edb4031f3.avif?t=1759179387\" alt=\"Distinctive flap-style movement\" data-has-big width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master movement in this unique twist on the genre. Flap left or right to move horizontally, and adjust your flapping speed to control altitude. You can also dash sideways to dodge tricky projectiles. This elegant control scheme is easy to learn, yet offers expressive, skillful movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/191561bf189c03e5aec91b34fde47d73.avif?t=1759179387\" alt=\"Epic boss battles\" data-has-big width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer huge bosses at the end of each level. With layered attack patterns and multiple phases, these extended battles deliver a distinct challenge beyond regular enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/extras/10336a65d4d2331334b165b96d0c15ba.avif?t=1759179387\" alt=\"Immense power trip\" data-has-big width=1560 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When defeated, you lose your coins and restart from the beginning of the level, but keep your acquired Wishes. This makes you more powerful each time you begin a new run, creating a thrilling sense of exponential domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Corporate Potato"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3365940","name":"Well Keeper"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994590/377133cce83db685dcbdf395a5dd0b2b82207a8b/header.jpg?t=1759179387","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3994590/940049339/819df2d5d6755d0fa3cb66e38430feff72ec06f7/1758711419/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759135878","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3994590/940049339/819df2d5d6755d0fa3cb66e38430feff72ec06f7/1758711419/